/* 与老师工作台、「我的学生详情」（设计稿 E06）同一套：蓝色渐变头部、#FAFAFA 面板、白色大圆角卡片、主题橙渐变主按钮。 */
page { background: #FAFAFA; color: #24332D; }
.add-root { position: relative; display: flex; min-height: 100vh; flex-direction: column; background: #FAFAFA; }
.add-ambient { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; z-index: 0; width: 100%; height: 560rpx; pointer-events: none; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #1E87FD 0%, #4BA5FF 74%, rgba(250, 250, 250, 0) 100%); }
.add-topbar { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; z-index: 20; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; background: transparent; }
.add-topbar-inner { position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; box-sizing: content-box; padding: 0 32rpx 16rpx; }
.add-back { display: flex; flex: 0 0 auto; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 54rpx; height: 54rpx; border-radius: 50%; }
.add-back:active { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .16); }
.add-back-icon { width: 22rpx; height: 22rpx; border-bottom: 4rpx solid #FFFFFF; border-left: 4rpx solid #FFFFFF; transform: rotate(45deg) scale(.7); }
.add-topbar-title { position: absolute; left: 50%; display: block; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 36rpx; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -1rpx; transform: translateX(-50%); white-space: nowrap; }

/* 头部说明：白字压在蓝色渐变上 */
.add-hero { position: relative; z-index: 1; flex: 0 0 auto; padding: 0 40rpx 62rpx; }
.add-hero-title { display: block; margin-top: 26rpx; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 38rpx; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3; }
.add-hero-copy { display: block; margin-top: 12rpx; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .86); font-size: 23rpx; line-height: 1.55; }

/* 面板：圆角上沿压住蓝色头部 */
.add-panel { position: relative; z-index: 2; margin-top: -24rpx; padding: 36rpx 28rpx calc(48rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); flex: 1; box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 26rpx 26rpx 0 0; background: #FAFAFA; }
.section-heading { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin: 0 4rpx 20rpx; color: #24332D; font-size: 28rpx; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; }
.section-note { display: block; margin: 24rpx 4rpx 0; color: #939C96; font-size: 20rpx; line-height: 1.6; text-align: center; }
.card { box-sizing: border-box; border: 0; border-radius: 28rpx; background: #FFFFFF; box-shadow: none; }

/* 6 位用户 ID：白色大胶囊，数字居中加字距 */
.code-field { position: relative; display: flex; height: 112rpx; padding: 0 40rpx; box-sizing: border-box; align-items: center; border: 2rpx solid transparent; border-radius: 999rpx; background: #FFFFFF; }
.code-field.is-error { border-color: rgba(232, 95, 77, .55); }
.code-input { min-width: 0; height: 112rpx; flex: 1; color: #24332D; font-size: 44rpx; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 14rpx; line-height: 112rpx; text-align: center; }
.code-placeholder { color: #B3BBB5; font-size: 28rpx; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0; }
.code-clear { position: absolute; top: 50%; right: 28rpx; display: flex; width: 40rpx; height: 40rpx; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border-radius: 50%; background: #F0F3F0; color: #8C9890; font-size: 28rpx; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1; transform: translateY(-50%); }
.add-error { display: block; margin: 16rpx 8rpx 0; color: #D6574B; font-size: 22rpx; line-height: 1.5; text-align: center; }
.add-submit { display: flex; width: 100%; height: 92rpx; margin: 32rpx 0 0; padding: 0; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border-radius: 999rpx; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #FF9F43 0%, #FD7C02 100%); color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 28rpx; font-weight: 600; line-height: 92rpx; }
.add-submit::after { border: 0; }
.add-submit:active { opacity: .82; }
.add-submit[disabled] { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #FF9F43 0%, #FD7C02 100%) !important; color: #FFFFFF !important; opacity: .42; }

/* 添加结果：学生卡片 + 两个操作 */
.result-card { display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 28rpx 26rpx; }
.result-avatar { display: block; width: 96rpx; height: 96rpx; flex: 0 0 96rpx; border-radius: 50%; background: #EAF3FF; }
.result-copy { min-width: 0; margin-left: 22rpx; flex: 1; }
.result-name, .result-meta { display: block; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
.result-name { color: #27332C; font-size: 30rpx; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.35; }
.result-meta { margin-top: 6rpx; color: #929B95; font-size: 22rpx; line-height: 1.4; }
.result-badge { flex: none; margin-left: 16rpx; padding: 6rpx 16rpx; border-radius: 999rpx; background: #E8F5EC; color: #2F7A4F; font-size: 20rpx; font-weight: 600; }
.result-badge.is-muted { background: #EAF3FF; color: #1E87FD; }
.result-actions { display: flex; margin-top: 28rpx; gap: 18rpx; }
.result-action { display: flex; height: 88rpx; flex: 1; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border-radius: 999rpx; background: #FFFFFF; color: #59675F; font-size: 26rpx; font-weight: 600; }
.result-action.is-primary { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #FF9F43 0%, #FD7C02 100%); color: #FFFFFF; }
.result-action:active { opacity: .78; }

/* 老师身份核对失败 */
.empty-card { display: flex; padding: 56rpx 32rpx; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; }
.empty-title { color: #24332D; font-size: 27rpx; font-weight: 600; }
.empty-copy { margin-top: 12rpx; color: #89938C; font-size: 22rpx; line-height: 1.6; }
.empty-retry { margin-top: 24rpx; padding: 14rpx 36rpx; border-radius: 999rpx; background: #EAF3FF; color: #1E87FD; font-size: 23rpx; font-weight: 600; }
.empty-retry:active { opacity: .78; }

@import "./index.large.wxss"; /* 平板、电脑大屏样式：由 scripts/build-large-screen-styles.mjs 生成，改完本文件后重跑；这一行须留在文件末尾 */
